1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,136
Kalau mendongak ke kolong tol

2
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:04,540
layang, balok beton raksasa ternyata

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,761
tidak menempel langsung di kepala

4
00:00:06,761 --> 00:00:07,035
tiang.

5
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:09,971
Di antaranya terselip kotak hitam

6
00:00:09,971 --> 00:00:12,545
setebal bantal yang sanggup memikul

7
00:00:12,545 --> 00:00:14,432
beban ribuan ton truk tanpa

8
00:00:14,432 --> 00:00:14,912
gepeng.

9
00:00:15,339 --> 00:00:17,590
Jika balok jembatan dibaut mati

10
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,477
ke tiang beton,

11
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:20,315
lengkungan truk dan muai panas

12
00:00:20,315 --> 00:00:21,805
akan memecahkan tiang.

13
00:00:22,244 --> 00:00:24,274
Kotak itu adalah elastomeric bearing:

14
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:25,796
lapis karet sintetis dan pelat

15
00:00:25,796 --> 00:00:27,848
baja tipis yang divulkanisasi menyatu.

16
00:00:28,093 --> 00:00:30,613
Pelat baja menahan karet agar

17
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:31,563
tak meluber,

18
00:00:31,563 --> 00:00:34,047
sedangkan lapis karetnya lentur

19
00:00:34,047 --> 00:00:35,727
bergeser maju-mundur.

20
00:00:36,116 --> 00:00:38,472
Batasnya, jembatan bentang raksasa

21
00:00:38,472 --> 00:00:40,731
atau zona gempa ekstrem memakai

22
00:00:40,731 --> 00:00:42,418
bantalan pot baja khusus.

23
00:00:43,096 --> 00:00:44,844
Pernah sadar ada bantal hitam

24
00:00:44,844 --> 00:00:46,054
ini di atas tiang tol?

25
00:00:46,054 --> 00:00:47,103
Tulis di komentar,

26
00:00:47,103 --> 00:00:48,528
dan tekan tombol putih di

27
00:00:48,528 --> 00:00:49,954
bawah agar dapat hal yang

28
00:00:49,954 --> 00:00:50,680
gak disangka!

